@Posnex.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5071
@token = {{accessToken}}
@businessId = {{businessId}}

### Registrar usuario
POST {{Posnex.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "owner@example.com",
  "password": "{{strongPassword}}"
}

### Iniciar sesión; usa el accessToken devuelto en las siguientes solicitudes
POST {{Posnex.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/login?useCookies=false
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "owner@example.com",
  "password": "{{strongPassword}}"
}

### Crear restaurante (tipo: Restaurant o Ecommerce)
POST {{Posnex.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/businesses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Casa Olivo",
  "type": "Restaurant",
  "primaryColor": "#304D3D",
  "secondaryColor": "#E6C98B",
  "logoUrl": null
}

### Listar negocios de la cuenta autenticada
GET {{Posnex.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/businesses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Consultar negocio propio
GET {{Posnex.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/businesses/{{businessId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Actualizar nombre y marca (el tipo elegido al crear no cambia)
PUT {{Posnex.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/businesses/{{businessId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Casa Olivo Centro",
  "primaryColor": "#304D3D",
  "secondaryColor": "#E6C98B",
  "logoUrl": null
}

### Eliminar negocio (borrado lógico; sin eliminación física de datos)
DELETE {{Posnex.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/businesses/{{businessId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
###
